DSHOptimizeMosire · dsh-liangshen-anchored
==========================================

This package ports the community "anchored standard" LiangShen agent preset to
the current DeepSeek Harness preset declaration mechanism. It is not an
official DeepSeek preset and is not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepSeek.

Upstream sources and licenses
-----------------------------
1. DeepSeek Harness built-in presets (`minimal`, `standard`, `ptc`)
   Copyright DeepSeek, MIT License.
   The `persona` row and the bootstrap tool pair (`bash` + `str_replace_editor`)
   are byte-compatible with the shipped `minimal` preset.

2. @deepseek-harness-tui/dsh-tui `presets/liangshen/` (revision
   `liangshen-ptc-runtime-compat-v7`), MIT License.
   Files ported verbatim: `tool-bootstrap.mjs`, `instruction-hint.mjs`,
   `skill-search.mjs`, `custom-bash.mjs`, `compaction-epoch.mjs`,
   `session-events.mjs`, and the composition baseline.

3. xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard `preset/context-gate.mjs`, MIT License.
   Ported verbatim as the unified injection gate (runtime-context blanking +
   pre-step allowlist) added on top of the v7 composition.

